OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition kicks off at
OL,7,     FRosaire Guest House in Llandudno,
OL,8,     Fwhere host Jo and her mum Pat end
OL,9,     Fup with some illuminating feedback
OL,10,     Fabout their guests' lack of sleep.
OL,11,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FAt The Queens Hotel in Harlech,
OL,13,     FRachel and professional
OL,14,     Fimpersonator Liam are keen to make
OL,15,     Fa good impression. But an issue in
OL,16,     Fthe bathroom gives one B&Ber that
OL,17,     Fsinking feeling.
