OL,5,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FFor the third visit of the week,
OL,7,     Fthe B&Bers head to Mat and Helen's
OL,8,     FB&B, The Mill at Glynhir in
OL,9,     FLlandybie, Carmarthenshire, where
OL,10,     Fthings get prickly during a visit
OL,11,     Fto a botanical garden.
OL,12,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe final visit is to Lesley and
OL,14,     FSarah's Hideaway Escapes in
OL,15,     FPembrokeshire, where one set of
OL,16,     Fguests' decision to sleep in their
OL,17,     Fcar rather than their room leaves
OL,18,     Fthe hosts all revved up.
